# AWS Lambda (Future)

- Do not deploy to AWS during initial implementation.
- Each microservice independently deployable via CDK v2.
- Separate app entry points and Lambda handlers.
- Do not package Windows `.venv` for Lambda; build Linux artifacts.
- Heavy GPU workloads use external inference; Lambda orchestrates.
- Adapters: DynamoDB, S3, EventBridge, SQS, Step Functions, Cognito, Bedrock, Secrets Manager.
